WEBVTT

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:08.160
To the south of the continent of Allacraste lies an island known as Lodos.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:16.790
Forged in the fierce battle between Martha, the Goddess of Creation, and Cardis, the Goddess of Destruction,

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.420
Lodos has come to be known as the Accursed Island.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:30.000
And now, in a land whose history is painted with the hues of war, new ambitions are stirring.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.620
Why has a knight of marmo come to this far-off place?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:39.340
What brings you to this holy temple of Marfa, goddess of the earth?

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:42.990
You know about that sword, don't you?

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:47.410
From the very beginning, it's brought nothing but suffering.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.550
It was first used by the king of the demons.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:54.930
The soul crusher should be locked away where no one can ever retrieve it.

00:03:54.930 --> 00:04:00.000
I did not come this far for a history lesson about my sword, priestess.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.530
I have a question for you.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.230
Will you answer me truthfully?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.220
I will not lie.

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:09.190
However...

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:09.670
Very well.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:12.610
A simple answer will reveal what I need to know.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.480
I want you to tell me about the treasure of the Ice Dragon brand.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.190
Why do you need to know about that?

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:23.960
I am a greedy man who wishes to take Bram's treasure for myself.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:30.000
Long ago, the glorious kingdom of sorcery entrusted the five ancient dragons with

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:34.100
the Governor's treasures, appointing them guardians for all eternity.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:37.450
However, the Ice Dragon brand had no treasure.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.570
But that means you must have seen him.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:43.890
Indeed. He gave us a rather nasty welcome.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:48.400
However, I'm absolutely certain the Ice Dragon regrets that now.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:58.160
What have you done? I can't believe you'd actually attack and kill a hibernating dragon.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.480
Or would you?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:04.010
It's been rumored you are the one who released Bram from his terrible curse.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:08.480
As a reward for his freedom, he gave you one of his treasures. Is that so?

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:13.930
I sold off that treasure to help pay for the upkeep of this holy temple of Marfa.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:20.760
I see. But any treasure that could be traded for money would be of no use to me.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.170
