00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.960
I am Ashram, loyal servant of Emperor Beld of Marmo.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.610
The man who united this accursed island.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:37.490
And now I have a question for you, Sir Ashram.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:41.700
